# Support

This documentation describes a local proof of concept. It is not a production service status page.

## Repository

Source and contribution history live in the [hmcts/tec-poc](https://github.com/hmcts/tec-poc) repository. Prefer opening issues or pull requests there for documentation gaps, architecture questions, or local-stack problems.

## Local preview

With `./gradlew bootWithCCD` (or `./bin/start-design-docs.sh`), the Tech Docs site is at [http://localhost:4567](http://localhost:4567).

## Architecture reference

Start with [TEC decentralised CCD architecture](/ccd-architecture.html) and [CFTLib database layout](/cftlib-shared-database.html).
